+      <h3>Booking notice</h3>
+      <p>Drop-off & tray orders under 50 guests: 48–72 hours' notice (rush orders inside 48 hours are subject to availability and a possible rush fee). Large events & full-service spreads of 50–150+ guests: 7–10 days. Major holidays and peak season: 14 days recommended — slots across the DMV corridor fill fast.</p>
