+      <p>Final guest count and menu selections are due 4 days (96 hours) before your event. We'll try to accommodate guest increases up to 48 hours out, subject to ingredient availability. Decreases after the 4-day deadline can't be refunded, since fresh ingredients and prep are already locked in.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="faq-item">
+      <h3>Deposits & payment</h3>
+      <p>Standard orders are paid in full at booking. Large-scale or custom events require a 50% non-refundable deposit to hold your date, with the balance due 48 hours before the event. We accept major credit/debit cards, electronic invoicing, and authorized business accounts.</p>
